  ra_https_how_2: 'In your tailnet’s admin console turn on "HTTPS Certificates": it is a switch for the whole network, and without it no certificate is issued.',
  ra_https_how_3: 'Install Tailscale on the phone or tablet too, and sign in with the SAME account.',
  ra_https_how_4: 'Turn the VPN switch on on the phone, then scan the QR above.',
  ra_https_phone_note: 'Tailscale has to stay on on the phone: this address exists only inside your private network, not in public DNS. That is also why no port is open on your router.',
  ra_https_setup: 'Set it up for me',
