// -- Beta marks: the two platforms and the one feature that are new ----------
// macOS/Linux and paired-device access ship as beta, and a badge on its own
// reads as a warning about safety. Each carries a line that says what beta
// means here instead: the dashboard is the same everywhere, what differs is the
// part that reads the machine. {os} is filled in by renderPlatformBeta in
// js/settings.js, so it has to survive translation.
