// ── File transfer (v4.11.0) — the widget, the phone sheet and its settings ──
// The "cannot" lines are not decoration. Two of them state a limit of iOS
// itself: WebKit does not implement Web Share Target, so Xenon can never appear
// in the iOS share sheet, and a downloaded photo lands in Files rather than the
// camera roll. Saying so where the user is, is the difference between a
// boundary and a bug report.

