// v4.11 i18n gap fill. These keys were referenced by the dashboard but defined
// nowhere, so every language rendered the call site's hardcoded English fallback
// — including Italian. `deck_param_claude_prompt` is new: claudeAsk and the ai
// action share the param NAME `prompt`, and a single key could only ever label
// one of them (the other definition was silently shadowed).
// Where an identical string already existed (no_upcoming, close, gallery_back)
// the wording is reused verbatim rather than re-translated, so the same sentence
