// ── The paired phone (v4.11.0) — widget, settings and the limits it states ──
// The "no answer" line is the important one and it is not an apology: the
// Bluetooth channel that would accept a call belongs to the operating system,
// so the button is absent by design. A user who is told that stops looking for
// it; a user who is not files a bug about a feature that was never possible.

